    "show_share": true,
    "description": "For Wahab Fazal, an MBBS student at Aga Khan University, the journey to becoming a doctor started in his small town in Dera Ismail Khan. Despite coming from a community where AKU was seen as an almost unattainable dream, Wahab spent his formative years developing resilience and discipline, preparing himself to achieve what seemed impossible.",
